{"_id":"69951bdd1a5b231013bbbe3a","title":"Realistic First person script","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-Realistic-First-person-script-113177","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":2209,"executes":697,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/19a85aa481e66655748b7a421dce4305c060a8f27b345c336c4f1f3d44b17d01.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1771379677386.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1771379677386.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/19a85aa481e66655748b7a421dce4305c060a8f27b345c336c4f1f3d44b17d01.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1771379677386.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1771379677386.png"},"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-02-18T01:54:37.398Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:54:37.398Z","lastBump":"2026-02-18T01:54:37.398Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastebin.com/raw/s3djuewJ\"))()","features":"Realistic First Person Features:\n\n1:1 Body Sync: Your character’s body turns exactly when your mouse moves. No more \"laggy\" head or floating limbs—the body is locked to your view for perfect realism.\n\nLanding Impact: When you fall or jump, the camera \"dips\" down to simulate your knees absorbing the impact. It gives your character a sense of physical weight and gravity.\n\nDynamic Lean & Tilt: When you turn fast or move side-to-side, the camera tilts slightly on its side. This mimics how a real person leans their head into a turn or a stride.\n\nBreathing & Step Bob: The camera has a gentle \"breathing\" motion when you stand still and a rhythmic \"step\" shake when you walk. This makes it feel like you are looking through real eyes rather than a floating camera.\n\nCatalog Auto-Hide: No more hats, hair, or bulky helmets blocking your face. The script automatically detects your accessories and hides them if they get too close to the camera lens, ensuring a clear view.\n\nThe Ghost Shield: Even though this is a realism script, it has a \"Ghost\" layer hidden inside. It blocks anti-cheats from seeing the camera changes, so you don't get flagged for \"suspicious\" movement.","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6882c9dae6f69d3860174167","username":"breezipsettings","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lvl":8,"status":"offline","id":"6882c9dae6f69d3860174167","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T17:28:43.159Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69951bdd1a5b231013bbbe3d","editBy":{"_id":"6882c9dae6f69d3860174167","username":"breezipsettings","status":"offline","id":"6882c9dae6f69d3860174167"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-02-18T01:54:37.402Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6ab5dbe3d007db08c094625c","commentBy":{"_id":"6913b14530e0715554e0b6a1","username":"tyellinwood","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lastActive":"2026-10-06T03:19:19.267Z","createdAt":"2025-11-11T21:57:25.134Z","status":"offline","id":"6913b14530e0715554e0b6a1","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"if your character got custom animations, will the camera follow the head or will the camera stay in place","edit